# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/visualstudio,windows,linux
# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=visualstudio,windows,linux

## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
##
## Local .gitignore file (not committed to repository)
## Use this file in your project root to exclude specific files from source control
## *.user is intentionally not included as it can contain machine specific data
## unless it's explicitly added to the repo.
